\f1\fs22 Chanta ran from the scene of the crime. He\'92d killed a man. Or the wall had, or whoever designed the wall had, but surely someone would blame him. That\'92s how these things worked. Never mind that polite society cared little for naked drunks; someone always needed blaming, and Chanta had the blood on the floor to prove he\'92d been there. If anything, they\'92d probably send the man\'92s family a cleaning bill.\
